         Canon manifestation B of the RAG status set: dense tables / dashboards where a COLUMN IS
         the status and scan speed matters. Distinct from the tint chip above: the chip is the CALM
         rung (tint ground, text/default ink); this is the LOUD rung (signal fill, ruled knockout ink).
         Ink slots follow the Banner precedent exactly — err/warn ride rag/text/on-light, success rides
